mopenzl
=======

This crate is a Rust port of the OpenZL reference library from
https://github.com/facebook/openzl (v0.3.0, commit 32246b48).

Portions of this software — the frame and chunk header layouts, the format
limits, the default graph's decisions (minimum stream size, store on
expansion, serial segmentation), the XXH3 secret and constants it vendors, and
the decoder's stream wiring — are derived from that work, which is
distributed under the BSD license reproduced below. The upstream license text
is also vendored verbatim at `openzl-ffi/vendor/openzl/LICENSE`. Zstandard
coding is provided by the `mzstd` crate.

